 # CHANGELOG (last updated 24th October 2026, UTC)
 
+#### VERSION 2026.10.27-ALPHA	
+
+- New study method: **Endless Drill** (full-width row on the Study picker) — per chunk: multiple choice → fill-the-gaps → written, repeating only your misses until each card is right once; after the last chunk, an endless written loop until you Finish
+- Two varieties: chunked (10 cards by default, adjustable 5–25 on the card) and unchunked (whole scope as one part); basic cards only
+- Endless XP: full the first time a card is correct in each pass type (choice / gaps / written), half for repeats and endless-loop cycles; review schedules stay untouched
+
 #### VERSION 2026.10.26-ALPHA	
 
 - New SRS option: **Crucible (Adaptive, in-house)** — personalises review intervals from various data points.
